{"unit_id":2,"stage_id":2,"lesson":{"lesson_id":1,"lesson_key":"S2L1","stage_id":2,"title":"Harf-e-Ta'keed 'Inna': الْكِتَابُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Harf-e-Ta'keed 'Inna': الْكِتَابُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ","en":"Emphatic Particle 'Inna' (Verily): الْكِتَابُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ","ur":"حرفِ تاکید 'إِنَّ': الْكِتَابُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ","hi":"हर्फ़-ए-ताकीद 'इन्ना': الْكِتَابُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ"},"arabic_Focus":"الْكِتَابُ ، اللَّهُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ ، إِنَّ اللَّهَ","hinglish_Focus":"Kitaab, Allah (Pesh ـُ) → Beshak Kitaab, Beshak Allah (Zabar ـَ)","page_numbers":"52–53","book_page":52,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"الْكِتَابُ ، اللَّهُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ ، إِنَّ اللَّهَ","hinglish":"Kitaab, Allah (Pesh ـُ) → Beshak Kitaab, Beshak Allah (Zabar ـَ)","arabic_word":"الْكِتَابُ ، اللَّهُ","arabic_combined":"الْكِتَابُ ، اللَّهُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ ، إِنَّ اللَّهَ","hinglish_word":"Kitaab, Allah (Pesh ـُ)","hinglish_combined":"Kitaab, Allah (Pesh ـُ) → Beshak Kitaab, Beshak Allah (Zabar ـَ)","title_en":"Harf-e-Ta'keed 'Inna': الْكِتَابُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ","subtitle":"Unit 2 • Lesson 1 (Book Page 52–53)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"الْكِتَابُ ، اللَّهُ","after_ar":"إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ ، إِنَّ اللَّهَ","before_hi":"Kitaab, Allah (Pesh ـُ)","after_hi":"Beshak Kitaab, Beshak Allah (Zabar ـَ)"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S2L1 — Harf-e-Ta'keed 'Inna': الْكِتَابُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S2L1 — Harf-e-Ta'keed 'Inna': الْكِتَابُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qaa'ida / Halat","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["إِنَّ + Ism (Zabar ـَ)","إِنَّ اللَّهَ / إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ / إِنَّ الْإِنْسَانَ","Beshak Allah / Beshak Kitaab / Beshak insaan"],["فَإِنَّ (Toh beshak)","فَإِنَّ اللَّهَ غَفُورٌ رَحِيمٌ","Pas beshak Allah bakhshne wala meherbaan hai"],["إِنَّ ... لَـ (Dohri Ta'keed)","إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَسَاحِرٌ / إِنَّ الْأَبْرَارَ لَفِي نَعِيمٍ","Beshak yeh yaqeenan jaadugar hai / Beshak nek log ne'mat mein hain"]]}},{"id":"sec_s2l1_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 2 • LESSON 1</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Ta'keed 'Inna': الْكِتَابُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ (Page 52–53)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْكِتَابُ ، اللَّهُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Inna (إِنَّ + ـَ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ ، إِنَّ اللَّهَ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْكِتَابُ ، اللَّهُ (Kitaab, Allah (Pesh ـُ)) se إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ ، إِنَّ اللَّهَ (Beshak Kitaab, Beshak Allah (Zabar ـَ)) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Huroof-e-Jarr, Inna, Laa, Illaa, Kaana aur Yaa Qur'ani jumlon ki buniyadi chabiyan hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 52–53):** **`إِنَّ`** ka matlab **'Beshak / Yaqeenan'** hai. Jab kisi ism se pehle `إِنَّ` aata hai toh us ism ke aakhri harf ka Pesh (`ـُ`) badal kar **Zabar (`ـَ`)** ho jata hai: `الْكِتَابُ ← إِنَّ الْكِتَابَ`، `اللَّهُ ← إِنَّ اللَّهَ عَلِيمٌ`."}},{"id":"sec_s2l1_lbl2","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Darj zail misaalon par ghaur karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l1_r4","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Upar di gayi misaalon se wazeh hai ke Arabi mein 'Inna' (إِنَّ) ka matlab 'Beshak / Yaqeenan' hai. 'Inna' ta'keed ke liye jumle ke shuru mein aata hai. 'Inna' aur iske baad aane wala lafz milkar ek murakkab banaate hain. 'Inna' ke baad aane wale wahid ism par zabar (fatha) aata hai."}},{"id":"sec_s2l1_r5","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Darj zail aasan Qur'ani ibaarat khud samajh kar tarjuma karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l1_g6","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l1_g6_w1","arabic":"إِنَّ الْبَاطِلَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَاطِلَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak baatil","translations":{"en":"Indeed, falsehood","ur":"بیشک باطل","hi":"बेशक बातिल"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w2","arabic":"إِنَّ الشِّرْكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الشِّرْكَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak shirk","translations":{"en":"Indeed, polytheism","ur":"بیشک شرک","hi":"बेशक शिर्क"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w3","arabic":"إِنَّ الدِّينَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الدِّينَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak deen","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the religion","ur":"بیشک دین","hi":"बेशक दीन"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w4","arabic":"إِنَّ اللَّهَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Allah","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Allah","ur":"بیشک اللہ","hi":"बेशक अल्लाह"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w5","arabic":"إِنَّ الْعِزَّةَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعِزَّةَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak izzat","translations":{"en":"Indeed, all honor","ur":"بیشک عزت","hi":"बेशक इज़्ज़त"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w6","arabic":"إِنَّ الْمَوْتَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَوْتَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak maut","translations":{"en":"Indeed, death","ur":"بیشک موت","hi":"बेशक मौत"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w7","arabic":"إِنَّ الْهُدَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْهُدَى</span>","hinglish":"Beshak hidayat","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the guidance","ur":"بیشک ہدایت","hi":"बेशक हिदायत"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w8","arabic":"إِنَّ الصَّلَاةَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الصَّلَاةَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak namaz","translations":{"en":"Indeed, prayer","ur":"بیشک نماز","hi":"बेशक नमाज़"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w9","arabic":"إِنَّ الْأَمْرَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأَمْرَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak hukm","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the command","ur":"بیشک حکم","hi":"बेशक हुक्म"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w10","arabic":"إِنَّ الْقَوْمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقَوْمَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak qaum","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the people","ur":"بیشک قوم","hi":"बेशक क़ौम"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w11","arabic":"إِنَّ الْإِنْسَانَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِنْسَانَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak insaan","translations":{"en":"Indeed, mankind","ur":"بیشک انسان","hi":"बेशक इंसान"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w12","arabic":"إِنَّ الشَّيْطَانَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّيْطَانَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Shaytan","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Satan","ur":"بیشک شیطان","hi":"बेशक शैतान"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w13","arabic":"إِنَّ جَهَنَّمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">جَهَنَّمَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak jahannam","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Hell","ur":"بیشک جہنم","hi":"बेशक जहन्नम"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w14","arabic":"إِنَّ الْفَضْلَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْفَضْلَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak fazl","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the bounty","ur":"بیشک فضل","hi":"बेशक फ़ज़्ल"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w15","arabic":"إِنَّ الْعَاقِبَةَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَاقِبَةَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak anjam","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the outcome","ur":"بیشک انجام","hi":"बेशक अंजाम"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w16","arabic":"إِنَّ الْأَرْضَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأَرْضَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak zameen","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the earth","ur":"بیشک زمین","hi":"बेशक ज़मीन"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w17","arabic":"إِنَّ الظَّنَّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الظَّنَّ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak gumaan","translations":{"en":"Indeed, conjecture","ur":"بیشک گمان","hi":"बेशक गुमान"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w18","arabic":"إِنَّ السَّمْعَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّمْعَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak sunna","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the hearing","ur":"بیشک سننا (کان)","hi":"बेशक सुनना (कान)"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w19","arabic":"إِنَّ الْخِزْيَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْخِزْيَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak ruswai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, disgrace","ur":"بیشک رسوائی","hi":"बेशक रुसवाई"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w20","arabic":"إِنَّ السَّاعَةَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّاعَةَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak qayamat","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the Hour","ur":"بیشک قیامت","hi":"बेशक क़यामत"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w21","arabic":"إِنَّ إِبْرَاهِيمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِبْرَاهِيمَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Ibrahim (as)","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Abraham","ur":"بیشک ابراہیم (علیہ السلام)","hi":"बेशक इब्राहीम (अलैहिस्सलाम)"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w22","arabic":"إِنَّ ذَلِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ذَلِكَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak woh","translations":{"en":"Indeed, that","ur":"بیشک وہ","hi":"बेशक वह"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w23","arabic":"إِنَّ هَذَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">هَذَا</span>","hinglish":"Beshak yeh","translations":{"en":"Indeed, this","ur":"بیشک یہ","hi":"बेशक यह"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w24","arabic":"إِنَّ الْعَهْدَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَهْدَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak waada","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the covenant","ur":"بیشک عہد (وعدہ)","hi":"बेशक अहद (वादा)"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w25","arabic":"إِنَّ قَارُونَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَارُونَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Qaroon","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Korah (Qarun)","ur":"بیشک قارون","hi":"बेशक क़ारून"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w26","arabic":"إِنَّ فِرْعَوْنَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِرْعَوْنَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Fir'aun","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Pharaoh","ur":"بیشک فرعون","hi":"बेशक फ़िरऔन"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w27","arabic":"إِنَّ يَأْجُوجَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَأْجُوجَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Ya'jooj","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Gog (Yajuj)","ur":"بیشک یاجوج","hi":"बेशक याजूज"}},{"id":"s2l1_g6_w28","arabic":"إِنَّ ثَمُودَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ثَمُودَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Thamood","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Thamud","ur":"بیشک ثمود","hi":"बेशक समूद"}}],"cols":4}},{"id":"sec_s2l1_g7","type":"grace_box","data":{"text":"Kabhi kabhi 'Inna' ke baad do ya teen alfaaz 'Wa' (aur) se jud kar aate hain. Aise haal mein unka tarjuma milakar hota hai. Darj zail Qur'ani ibaarat khud samajh kar tarjuma karein."}},{"id":"sec_s2l1_g8","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l1_g8_w1","arabic":"إِنَّ الصَّفَا وَالْمَرْوَةَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الصَّفَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَرْوَةَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Safa aur Marwah","translations":{"en":"Indeed, as-Safa and al-Marwah","ur":"بیشک صفا اور مروہ","hi":"बेशक सफ़ा और मरवा"},"ref":"2:158"},{"id":"s2l1_g8_w2","arabic":"إِنَّ إِبْرَاهِيمَ وَإِسْمَاعِيلَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِبْرَاهِيمَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">إِسْمَاعِيلَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Ibrahim (as) aur Ismail (as)","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Abraham and Ishmael","ur":"بیشک ابراہیم اور اسماعیل (علیہما السلام)","hi":"बेशक इब्राहीम और इस्माईल (अलैहिमुस्सलाम)"},"ref":"2:140"},{"id":"s2l1_g8_w3","arabic":"إِنَّ يَأْجُوجَ وَمَأْجُوجَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَأْجُوجَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">مَأْجُوجَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Ya'jooj aur Ma'jooj","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Gog and Magog","ur":"بیشک یاجوج اور ماجوج","hi":"बेशक याजूज और माजूज"},"ref":"18:94"},{"id":"s2l1_g8_w4","arabic":"إِنَّ السَّمْعَ وَالْبَصَرَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّمْعَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَصَرَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak sunna aur dekhna","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the hearing and the sight","ur":"بیشک کان اور آنکھ (سننا اور دیکھنا)","hi":"बेशक कान और आँख (सुनना और देखना)"},"ref":"17:36"},{"id":"s2l1_g8_w5","arabic":"إِنَّ فِرْعَوْنَ وَهَامَانَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِرْعَوْنَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">هَامَانَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Fir'aun aur Haman","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Pharaoh and Haman","ur":"بیشک فرعون اور ہامان","hi":"बेशक फ़िरऔन और हामान"},"ref":"28:8"},{"id":"s2l1_g8_w6","arabic":"إِنَّ إِبْرَاهِيمَ وَإِسْمَاعِيلَ وَإِسْحَاقَ وَيَعْقُوبَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِبْرَاهِيمَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">إِسْمَاعِيلَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">إِسْحَاقَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">يَعْقُوبَ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Ibrahim (as) aur Ismail (as) aur Ishaq (as) aur Yaqoob (as)","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Abraham and Ishmael and Isaac and Jacob","ur":"بیشک ابراہیم، اسماعیل، اسحاق اور یعقوب (علیہم السلام)","hi":"बेशक इब्राहीम, इस्माईल, इसहाक़ और याक़ूब (अलैहिमुस्सलाम)"},"ref":"2:140"}]}},{"id":"sec_s2l1_g9","type":"grace_box","data":{"text":"Alhamdulillah, aapke pichle darson aur iss dars ne aapko darj zail Qur'ani jumloun ko aasaani se samajhne aur tarjuma karne ke qabil bana diya hai."}},{"id":"sec_s2l1_r10","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Darj zail Qur'ani ibaarat mein 'Inna' ke baad ek khabar bhi hai. Tarjuma karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l1_v11","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s2l1_v11_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"إِنَّ هَذَا/ عَدُوٌّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَذَا</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَدُوٌّ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak yeh dushman hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک یہ دشمن ہے","en":"Indeed, this is an enemy","hi":"बेशक यह दुश्मन है"},"ref":"20:117"},{"id":"s2l1_v11_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"إِنَّ هَذِهِ/ تَذْكِرَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَذِهِ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَذْكِرَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak yeh ek naseehat hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک یہ ایک نصیحت ہے","en":"Indeed, this is a reminder","hi":"बेशक यह एक नसीहत है"}},{"id":"s2l1_v11_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"إِنَّ اللَّهَ/ قَادِرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَادِرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Allah qadir hai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Allah is competent","ur":"یقیناً اللہ قادر ہے","hi":"यक़ीनन अल्लाह क़ादिर है"},"ref":"6:37"},{"id":"s2l1_v11_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"إِنَّ اللَّهَ/ مُخْرِجٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُخْرِجٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Allah zaahir karne wala hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک اللہ کے نزدیک دین اسلام ہی ہے","en":"Indeed, the religion in the sight of Allah is Islam","hi":"बेशक अल्लाह के नज़दीक दीन इस्लाम ही है"},"ref":"9:64"},{"id":"s2l1_v11_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"إِنَّ اللَّهَ/ سَمِيعٌ بَصِيرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">سَمِيعٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَصِيرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Allah sunne wala dekhne wala hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک اللہ سننے والا، دیکھنے والا ہے","en":"Indeed, Allah is Hearing and Seeing","hi":"बेशक अल्लाह सुनने वाला, देखने वाला है"},"ref":"22:75"},{"id":"s2l1_v11_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"إِنَّ اللَّهَ/ وَاسِعٌ عَلِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَاسِعٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Allah wus'at wala jaanne wala hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک اللہ وسعت والا، جاننے والا ہے","en":"Indeed, Allah is all-Encompassing and Knowing","hi":"बेशक अल्लाह वुसअत वाला, जानने वाला है"},"ref":"2:115"},{"id":"s2l1_v11_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"إِنَّ اللَّهَ/ عَلِيمٌ خَبِيرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلِيمٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَبِيرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Allah jaanne wala khabardaar hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک اللہ جاننے والا، خبردار ہے","en":"Indeed, Allah is Knowing and Acquainted","hi":"बेशक अल्लाह जानने वाला, ख़बरदार है"},"ref":"31:34"},{"id":"s2l1_v11_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"إِنَّ اللَّهَ/ غَفُورٌ شَكُورٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">غَفُورٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَكُورٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Allah bakhshne wala qadardaan hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک اللہ بخشنے والا، قدردان ہے","en":"Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Appreciative","hi":"बेशक अल्लाह बख़्शने वाला, क़द्रदान है"},"ref":"42:23"},{"id":"s2l1_v11_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"إِنَّ السَّاعَةَ/ آتِيَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّاعَةَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">آتِيَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak qayamat aane wali hai","translations":{"ur":"بیشک قیامت آنے والی ہے","en":"Indeed, the Hour is coming","hi":"बेशक क़ियामत आने वाली है"},"ref":"20:15"}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s2l1_r12","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Kabhi kabhi 'Fa' (فَ) 'Inna' ke shuru mein aata hai, jiska matlab hai 'Toh beshak' ya 'Phir beshak'. Iss liye 'Fa-Inna' (فَإِنَّ) ka matlab hai 'Phir beshak'. Iss baat ko zehn mein rakh kar darj zail Qur'ani ibaarat aur ayaat ka tarjuma karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l1_v13","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s2l1_v13_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ اللَّهَ/ عَلِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Phir beshak Allah jaanne wala hai","translations":{"ur":"پھر بیشک اللہ جاننے والا ہے","en":"Then indeed, Allah is Knowing","hi":"फिर बेशक अल्लाह जानने वाला है"},"ref":"3:63"},{"id":"s2l1_v13_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ اللَّهَ/ غَنِيٌّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">غَنِيٌّ</span>","hinglish":"Phir beshak Allah beniyaaz hai","translations":{"ur":"پھر بیشک اللہ بے نیاز ہے","en":"Then indeed, Allah is Free of need","hi":"फिर बेशक अल्लाह बेनियाज़ है"}},{"id":"s2l1_v13_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ اللَّهَ/ سَمِيعٌ عَلِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">سَمِيعٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Phir beshak Allah sunne wala jaanne wala hai","translations":{"ur":"پھر بیشک اللہ سننے والا، جاننے والا ہے","en":"Then indeed, Allah is Hearing and Knowing","hi":"फिर बेशक अल्लाह सुनने वाला, जानने वाला है"},"ref":"2:227"},{"id":"s2l1_v13_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ اللَّهَ/ غَفُورٌ رَحِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">غَفُورٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَحِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Phir beshak Allah bakhshne wala meharban hai","translations":{"ur":"پھر بیشک اللہ بخشنے والا، مہربان ہے","en":"Then indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful","hi":"फिर बेशक अल्लाह बख़्शने वाला, मेहरबान है"},"ref":"2:192"},{"id":"s2l1_v13_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ اللَّهَ/ شَاكِرٌ عَلِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَاكِرٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Phir beshak Allah qadardaan jaanne wala hai","translations":{"en":"Then indeed, Allah is Appreciative and Knowing","ur":"تو یقیناً اللہ قدردان، خوب جاننے والا ہے","hi":"तो यक़ीनन अल्लाह क़दरदान, खूब जानने वाला है"},"ref":"2:158"},{"id":"s2l1_v13_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ اللَّهَ/ عَزِيزٌ حَكِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَزِيزٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَكِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Phir beshak Allah ghalib hikmat wala hai","translations":{"ur":"پھر بیشک اللہ غالب، حکمت والا ہے","en":"Then indeed, Allah is Exalted in Might and Wise","hi":"फिर बेशक अल्लाह ग़ालिब, हिकमत वाला है"},"ref":"8:49"},{"id":"s2l1_v13_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ اللَّهَ/ غَنِيٌّ حَمِيدٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">غَنِيٌّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَمِيدٌ</span>","hinglish":"Phir beshak Allah beniyaaz hamd ke laayiq hai","translations":{"ur":"پھر بیشک اللہ بے نیاز، حمد کے لائق ہے","en":"Then indeed, Allah is Free of need and Praiseworthy","hi":"फिर बेशक अल्लाह बेनियाज़, हम्द के लायक़ है"},"ref":"31:12"},{"id":"s2l1_v13_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ اللَّهَ/ عَدُوٌّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهَ</span>/ <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَدُوٌّ</span>","hinglish":"Phir beshak Allah dushman hai (kaafiron ka)","translations":{"ur":"پھر بیشک اللہ 